# run_pipeline_cycle
#
# Entry point for the failure detection & auto-retry pipeline.
#
# OPERATING MODES:
#   1. WEBHOOK MODE: Called by Databricks job failure notification.
#      - Triggered automatically when any configured job fails
#      - Processes only the specific failure that triggered it
#      - Zero compute cost when no failures occur
#
#   2. PERIODIC MODE (fallback): Run as scheduled job every 15 minutes.
#      - Scans for new failures, processes retries, checks outcomes
#      - Acts as safety net for retries missed during webhook processing
#
# HOW TO CONFIGURE:
#   - For webhook: Set this notebook as the target for job failure webhooks
#   - For periodic: Schedule as 15-min job (fallback/safety net)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

